{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RC:CM continues to grow with regular updates and feature improvements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are constantly refining systems, expanding content, and enhancing the overall experience based on community feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RC:CM - Radio Controlled: Car Maniacs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RC:CM is more than just a game \u2014 it is a simulation of controlling a scaled radio-controlled car with attention to physics, detail, and the feel of real RC racing.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/001702ee03447f311c833cfafaa70853.avif?t=1772381367\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><br><strong>RC:CM immerses you in the world of modern radio-controlled vehicles.</strong>  <br>Race 7 different RC cars across 10 unique tracks, each belonging to one of 5 vehicle classes. Dynamic weather directly affects race conditions.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/d73ef78064cdae3edcd3f23a1ea913ed.avif?t=1772381367\" width=1560 height=882 /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other players in multiplayer mode, improve your results, and fight for the best lap times. Rain, wind, and fog change car behavior and require adaptation on every track.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/4696ee2d13cd556b3b0f795d38c7fa23.avif?t=1772381367\" width=1560 height=474 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics</strong></h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Realistic RC car physics with mass and scale taken into account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Track surface directly affects grip and handling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Electric and gasoline (nitro) engines with distinct characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Detailed suspension behavior on uneven surfaces.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/7f8ab41fef662a86b190e7743e7f492d.poster.avif?t=1772381367\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/7f8ab41fef662a86b190e7743e7f492d.webm?t=1772381367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/7f8ab41fef662a86b190e7743e7f492d.mp4?t=1772381367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/46956216b23ff0c5ac39a3d153c8a99f.poster.avif?t=1772381367\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/46956216b23ff0c5ac39a3d153c8a99f.webm?t=1772381367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/46956216b23ff0c5ac39a3d153c8a99f.mp4?t=1772381367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Audio</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Carefully crafted movement and environment sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Realistic audio design of the tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Original soundtracks that enhance the racing atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Camera</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 A flexible camera system focused on creating striking screenshots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Screenshots saved in original quality without compression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Support for custom resolutions and image settings.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/907160e79d2b0d0df9164d6c6366d52b.avif?t=1772381367\" width=1560 height=548 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replays</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Record and replay races at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Save and share replays with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Fine-tuned playback options for smooth and clear race viewing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start your engines and hit the track.</strong></h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/7efc69a058af599c447afca4e44d6281.avif?t=1772381367\" width=1560 height=474 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I Thought I Should Fly Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2717940/5e606bb9d524a3c0eace092144fac0a29ce19847.jpg"},{"name":"I'll Look Down On Others","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2717940/250758697e825c4d28c660cb2895b64b6340a007.jpg"},{"name":"Alpha Tester","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2717940/a92b12a590d3e0d5134bca29fdc87b5e3142af1f.jpg"},{"name":"It's time to Clean Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2717940/cf1e96578782edb08490229d24f9ac09d0475c75.jpg"},{"name":"AFK Plaeyr","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2717940/2fa418d311c7ec54b19a78559eabd993663f867e.jpg"},{"name":"Music Lover","path":"https://c