k. The game does not contain explicit nudity, sexual acts, or adult-only content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RC:CM continues to grow with regular updates and feature improvements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are constantly refining systems, expanding content, and enhancing the overall experience based on community feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RC:CM - Radio Controlled: Car Maniacs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RC:CM is more than just a game \u2014 it is a simulation of controlling a scaled radio-controlled car with attention to physics, detail, and the feel of real RC racing.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/001702ee03447f311c833cfafaa70853.avif?t=1772381367\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><br><strong>RC:CM immerses you in the world of modern radio-controlled vehicles.</strong>  <br>Race 7 different RC cars across 10 unique tracks, each belonging to one of 5 vehicle classes. Dynamic weather directly affects race conditions.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/d73ef78064cdae3edcd3f23a1ea913ed.avif?t=1772381367\" width=1560 height=882 /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other players in multiplayer mode, improve your results, and fight for the best lap times. Rain, wind, and fog change car behavior and require adaptation on every track.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/4696ee2d13cd556b3b0f795d38c7fa23.avif?t=1772381367\" width=1560 height=474 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics</strong></h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragrap